scn 1
# One click of 450 bodies (footprint 2, 26 per row at pitch 3, x 60-135, z 108-159)
# sent to a point far east, on open ground (the pocket probe without its walls).
# The click is ONE selection of 450: issueSelection lands it as the client does,
# 64 commands per tick over ticks 1-8, so Legion makes eight 64-body formations
# (seven of 64 and one of 2). Analog of the legion-r9 61930 jam and, for the
# pocket, of the committed `pocket` probe (615 bodies there: 0 arrived by 2000).
# Position and click are the probe's: click (461, 206).
name split-450-open
ticks 4000
seed 7
map flat 640 300
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 450 rect 60 108 138 165 pitch=3
region goal 441 186 481 226
line far 300 0 300 300
at 1 move A 461 206
